<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Private Sessions — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#F8F6F3;--deep:#4A2F23;--soft:#6F553F;--card:#FFFDF9}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--deep)}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--deep),#8C5E3E);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:800}
    nav a{margin-left:10px;color:var(--soft);text-decoration:none}
    .hero{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:26px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--card);box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(74,47,35,0.06)}
    h1{margin:6px 0 6px}
    p.lead{color:var(--soft)}
    .columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}
    .inline-list{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .pill{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(74,47,35,0.06),transparent);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity 420ms ease,transform 420ms ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    .cta{margin-top:12px}

    @media (max-width:880px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.logo{width:48px;height:48px}}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div class="logo">PS</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--soft)">Private &amp; small-group offerings</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="events.html">Sessions</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Care</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="hero">
    <h1>Private &amp; small-group sessions</h1>
    <p class="lead">Bespoke sound arrangements tailored to the needs of a person, couple, or close group. These sessions prioritize focused release and directed integration work.</p>

    <div class="columns">
      <section class="card reveal" id="offerings">
        <h3>Offerings</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--soft)">Choose the shape that fits your time and intention.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:8px">
          <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:800">Private Alignment — 60 min</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--soft)">A focused solo session for recalibration and targeted work.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
            <div style="font-weight:800">Duet Care — 75 min</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--soft)">Shared session for two people. Good for couples or partners.</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:800">Group Intention — 90 min</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--soft)">Small groups (3–8) with an emphasis on processing and integration.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cta" style="margin-top:12px">
          <a href="book.html" class="btn" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--deep),#8C5E3E);color:#fff;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">Request private session</a>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--soft);font-size:13px">Before booking, please review medical contraindications: pregnancy, implanted medical devices, recent cranial surgery, or active seizures should be discussed with your provider.</div>
      </section>

      <aside class="card reveal" id="process">
        <h4>How it works</h4>
        <ol style="color:var(--soft)">
          <li>Brief intake conversation to frame intention.</li>
          <li>Curated sound architecture to support the stated focus.</li>
          <li>20-minute integration and aftercare suggestions.</li>
        </ol>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong>Preparation</strong>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--soft)">Wear comfortable clothing, let the facilitator know of allergies or sensors. Bring any personal items you wish to place nearby.</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong>Booking</strong>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--soft)">Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> to begin the intake process.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="card reveal" style="margin-top:18px;padding:18px" id="testimonials">
      <h3>What people notice</h3>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
        <blockquote style="margin:0;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(139,103,77,0.04),transparent);border-radius:8px">I left quieter and more focused than I expected — the practitioner guided me gently through release.</blockquote>
        <blockquote style="margin:0;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(139,103,77,0.04),transparent);border-radius:8px">We did a duet session and both felt moved and rebalanced.</blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px;padding:18px;max-width:980px;" id="cta2">
      <h3>Ready to arrange a session?</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--soft)">Begin with a 15-minute intake call so we can match the session design to your needs.</p>
      <a href="book.html" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--deep);color:#fff;font-weight:700">Start an intake</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with reduced-motion support (shared pattern)
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){reveals.forEach(r=>r.classList.add('visible'));return}
      const obs = new IntersectionObserver((entries, o)=>{entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('visible');o.unobserve(e.target)}});},{threshold:0.15});
      reveals.forEach(r=>obs.observe(r));
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}  
{"path":"pricing.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Invest — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#F6F1EA;--dark:#3F2B22;--warm:#A36E44;--muted:#7B6656}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--dark)}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:18px}
    .tier-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
    .tier{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(63,43,34,0.06)}
    .tier h4{margin:0 0 8px}
    .price{font-weight:900;font-size:22px;color:var(--warm)}
    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 480ms ease,transform 480ms ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    @media (max-width:980px){.tier-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--dark),var(--warm));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:800">PR</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Pricing &amp; packages</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="events.html">Sessions</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Care</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1>Investment &amp; packages</h1>
    <p class="note">We present compact options for single attendance and scaled offerings for deeper work.</p>

    <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3>Public sessions</h3>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div class="tier">
          <h4>Community Seat</h4>
          <div class="price">$30</div>
          <div class="note">Access to public evening gatherings. Suggested sliding scale available.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <h4>Morning Reset</h4>
          <div class="price">$40</div>
          <div class="note">Weekend daytime offering — lighter sounds and integration time.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <h4>Evening Extended</h4>
          <div class="price">$55</div>
          <div class="note">Longer session with extended integration and guided journaling period.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:26px">
      <h3>Private work</h3>
      <div class="tier-grid" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div class="tier">
          <h4>Focused Alignment — 60m</h4>
          <div class="price">$160</div>
          <div class="note">Single-person, tailored rhythm and aftercare notes.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tier">
          <h4>Duet Care — 75m</h4>
          <div class="price">$240</div>
